/F2 11 Tf (DUEDILLY ENTERPRISE COMPLIANCE & COUNTERPARTY RISK POLICY \(v2026.1\)) Tj T* /F1 10.5 Tf
() Tj T*
/F2 11 Tf (Section 1: General Principles) Tj T* /F1 10.5 Tf
(All counterparties onboarded by DueDilly employees must undergo automated screening against) Tj T*
(sanctions, watchlists, adverse media, and jurisdictional risk before contract execution.) Tj T*
(Clause 1.1 \(Sanctions screening, demo clause\): Every counterparty, its directors,) Tj T*
(shareholders and beneficial owners, and every vessel by IMO number, must be screened against) Tj T*
(the sanctions lists before onboarding and at each re-screen. A name-only match with strong) Tj T*
(similarity is a possible match and must be investigated. A match confirmed by a second) Tj T*
(identifier \(date of birth, registration number or IMO number\) must be escalated, and the) Tj T*
(relationship must not proceed.) Tj T*
(Clause 1.2 \(Adverse media, demo clause\): Adverse media from the last 24 months must be) Tj T*
(reviewed. Media alleging fraud, bribery or sanctions evasion is severe and must be) Tj T*
(investigated before approval. Other negative media must be recorded and considered.) Tj T*
(Clause 1.3 \(Beneficial ownership, demo clause\): The counterparty must disclose its ownership) Tj T*
(up to its ultimate beneficial owners. Nominee shareholders, bearer shares, an offshore) Tj T*
(holding company, or an unknown beneficial owner make ownership unclear and require enhanced) Tj T*
(due diligence.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
/F2 11 Tf (Section 2: Contract Value & Financial Exposure Thresholds) Tj T* /F1 10.5 Tf
(Clause 2.1: Any proposed engagement with anticipated contract value exceeding SGD 100,000) Tj T*
(\(one hundred thousand Singapore Dollars\) mandates comprehensive vendor due diligence) Tj T*
(questionnaire \(DDQ\) verification and beneficial ownership audit.) Tj T*
(Clause 2.2: Contracts exceeding SGD 500,000 require senior compliance officer sign-off and) Tj T*
(enhanced audited financial verification.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
/F2 11 Tf (Section 3: Politically Exposed Persons \(PEP\) & State Connections) Tj T* /F1 10.5 Tf
(Clause 3.6: Any counterparty where a director, senior executive, beneficial owner \(>10%\), or) Tj T*
(individual subject is declared as or matched to a Politically Exposed Person \(PEP\) requires) Tj T*
(immediate triggering of Enhanced Due Diligence \(EDD\) Questionnaire and source of funds) Tj T*
(declaration.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
/F2 11 Tf (Section 4: Country & Jurisdictional Risk) Tj T* /F1 10.5 Tf
(Clause 4.1: Counterparties incorporated in, operating from, or flagged under jurisdictions) Tj T*
(with a Transparency International Corruption Perceptions Index \(CPI\) score below 40, or) Tj T*
(listed on FATF Call for Action / Increased Monitoring, trigger mandatory DDQ disclosures.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
/F2 11 Tf (Section 5: Entity-Specific Risk Controls) Tj T* /F1 10.5 Tf
(Clause 5.2 \(Intermediaries\): All engagements categorized under "3rd Party Reps & Brokers",) Tj T*
(intermediaries, or sales agents mandate statutory due diligence questionnaires regardless of) Tj T*
(initial contract value.) Tj T*
(Clause 5.4 \(Maritime & Vessels\): Maritime vessels flying flags of convenience \(e.g., Panama,) Tj T*
(Liberia, Marshall Islands\) or exhibiting recorded AIS telemetry dark periods exceeding 12) Tj T*
(hours require mandatory vessel questionnaire submission, charterer verification, and IMO) Tj T*
(registry audit.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Annex: Supplier CDDQ policy template) Tj T*
() Tj T*
ET
endstream
